OL,3,GNEWSARing road roundabout blocked after
OL,4,Acrane overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA roundabout on the Lincoln ring road
OL,7,Fhas been closed after a crane
OL,8,Foverturned.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said the incident
OL,11,Fat the Riseholme roundabout, where the
OL,12,FA15 meets the A46, was reported at
OL,13,Fabout 11:15 BST.
OL,15,FThe force said the closure was
OL,16,Faffecting all traffic approaching the
OL,17,Froundabout and advised motorists to
OL,18,Favoid the area.
OL,20,FPolice said there were not believed to
OL,21,Fbe any serious injuries.
